{"title":"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In a parlor game, the magician asks one of the participants to think of a three digit number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c575397027fa799a159e0394d58a961e65cfd93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(abc)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> represent digits in base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> in the order indicated. The magician then asks this person to form the numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/0/b50d8595d6d3c3b1d17b43416942adde7f9504fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(acb)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/c/fdcb01bcf77cb5872caaf029fe521d891a87032d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(bca)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/9/f69569287ea30058b7d249a28c6042326c9e9b52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(bac)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/4/6442f6c099a77addba2d4282a86d6f6b1c47b043.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(cab)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/4/7c4af042fe0c06d2241afe3f3ea1c42d5aee49e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(cba)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, to add these five numbers, and to reveal their sum, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />. If told the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />, the magician can identify the original number, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c575397027fa799a159e0394d58a961e65cfd93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(abc)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />. Play the role of the magician and determine <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c575397027fa799a159e0394d58a961e65cfd93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(abc)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/6/aa6b9a232636523a5ba1d711b63d8c0025c37e09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N= 3194$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> be the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/5/3c5a1ceb95b62c9c34572681c80bee6671a5c9d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100a+10b+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"115\" height=\"14\" />. Observe that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/4/184966516a8f9bd31eb1728c1a50a4a354462d36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3194+m=222(a+b+c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"208\" height=\"18\" /> so\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/2/97290b737bbe1f40c3f47cef903ca8eacfa1f153.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[m\\equiv -3194\\equiv -86\\equiv 136\\pmod{222}\\]\" width=\"296\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>This reduces <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> to one of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/0/370940fff98f377f45638eaeb56ceaa312eeee44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$136, 358, 580, 802$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"132\" height=\"16\" />. But also <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/7/cb74fcdb368fa4de9091c3f75bfeb66f29b65155.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c=\\frac{3194+m}{222}&gt;\\frac{3194}{222}&gt;14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"279\" height=\"37\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/7/257ab4c4196eb8d15eb325a9d75ce41b465becb6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c\\geq 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"111\" height=\"15\" />. \nRecall that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/c/acc6d9a6172d35127b6cb37ea92192caf7029a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b, c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> refer to the digits the three digit number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c575397027fa799a159e0394d58a961e65cfd93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(abc)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, so of the four options, only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/e/e6e460f829d180b6b081ae98243d26334b1864fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = \\boxed{358}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"79\" height=\"23\" /> satisfies this inequality.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>As in Solution 1, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/c/c0c45f8eee49745cedc849b2fee9e3e57925566c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3194 + m \\equiv 222(a+b+c) \\pmod{222}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"298\" height=\"18\" />, and so as above we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/4/8f4d39e6f8aeba93f888b1b68165bfa6e4beacbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m \\equiv 136 \\pmod{222}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"156\" height=\"18\" />.\nWe can also take this equation modulo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />; note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/1/371eebb951c2d4b14919032ce65d81ec5b202f8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m \\equiv a+b+c \\pmod{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"180\" height=\"18\" />, so\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/0/c105bb5008bb9e2f3667dc0c35732c7c2b903be4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3194 + m \\equiv 222m \\implies 5m \\equiv 8 \\implies m \\equiv 7 \\pmod{9}.\\]\" width=\"434\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> mod <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/f/c3fa029d8ca802c03e5ae47eaf8f71d686cba1be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$136$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> mod <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/5/155fa3807f26f4268430319bb47b97658353ad8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$222$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />. There is a shared factor in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in both, but the Chinese Remainder Theorem still tells us the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> mod <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/c/92ccb7728d3898f9858435673beff982bcb3ac71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$666$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />, namely <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/f/d3f7fbf3c406d37fdef01bbcfd850785c4437dee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m \\equiv 358$\" width=\"66\" height=\"12\" /> mod <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/c/92ccb7728d3898f9858435673beff982bcb3ac71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$666$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />. We see that there are no other 3-digit integers that are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/9/ca91ac153a72ad54194b08bda66a0d551bc03e94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$358$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> mod <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/c/92ccb7728d3898f9858435673beff982bcb3ac71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$666$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/e/e6e460f829d180b6b081ae98243d26334b1864fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = \\boxed{358}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"79\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/6/24659c75090792caec7f38494c4784c51826b33b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=abc$\" width=\"60\" height=\"12\" /> then\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/0/33036b27795b257ed60c32262291f36ac698a934.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[N=222(a+b+c)-n\\]\" width=\"184\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/9/e99de0bf2b60f868f0f1946b15cd39e92564e66c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[N=222(a+b+c)-100a-10b-c=3194\\]\" width=\"349\" height=\"18\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/b/40b0844c062dc35b7b8e81442d0826281c015944.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;100a+10b+c&lt;1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"208\" height=\"14\" />, we get the inequality\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/2/7e2e5a12f80f87dc8238be8a654d776ee13235c8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[N&lt;222(a+b+c)&lt;N+1000\\]\" width=\"250\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311b2e2d5e57b894fefa106e32e3783eba2424ed.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3194&lt;222(a+b+c)&lt;4194\\]\" width=\"231\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/a/8fadde5e823c1697087db5c877046b34a0a41f61.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[14&lt;a+b+c&lt;19\\]\" width=\"152\" height=\"14\" />\nChecking each of the multiples of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/5/155fa3807f26f4268430319bb47b97658353ad8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$222$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/1/3217ee58eb33e643ba10928d97be2b68184d7236.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15\\cdot222$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/3/bb3cc88881f1af06e390db17f8f27fb68a09882a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18\\cdot222$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" /> by subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> from each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb8c8106cc29d25f51ccdf636dca62d07f5f1428.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$222(a+b+c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"109\" height=\"18\" />, we quickly find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/c/b0c53130eb1bfa03b85971f009126178aa6a3f9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=\\boxed{358}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"74\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>~ Nafer\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the five numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/1/5e1e6656c30413b1332cb729a637ed17320b38dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$222(a+b+c)-100a-10b-c=122a+212b+221c=122(a+b+c)+9(10b+11c)=3194$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"742\" height=\"20\" /> We can see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/5/74550e966638db60ac1ddc8901fffce0e251a462.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3194 \\equiv 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" /> （mod <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />） and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/b/e6b7fe0cb9416756dc2bc45aa7815e8bd9d1bb0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$122 \\equiv 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"14\" /> （mod <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />） so we need to make sure that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/b/5bb82b138efc13d7adba4b9250946662d01a5908.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c \\equiv 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" /> （mod <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />） by some testing. So we let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/e/71e49956a386cfa6c31b55b3a6cc604cc097b15e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c=9k+7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"146\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Then, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/d/72d43325a2e187fe2814c146032c8f85ddca04f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\leq a+b+c \\leq 27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"147\" height=\"17\" /> so only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/c/5fca74e50815e3876545e5d7a9034c664972d26f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7,16,25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"17\" /> lie in the interval\n</p><p>When we test <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/2/6a2c6f75169b87dc1c9cf2709d43704e095ce6f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c=25, 10b+11c=16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"239\" height=\"18\" />, impossible\n</p><p>When we test <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/6664dd73107a22ea692bb9f0c13686b88f70919e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c=16, 10b+11c=138, b=5,c=8,a=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>When we test <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/b/cfb6732a0f376e478c1d57426c232c0853543173.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c=7, 10b+11c=260$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"239\" height=\"18\" />, well, it's impossible\n</p><p>The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fff2cc8cd09d151021dd48666510bacf39152dce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{358}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"40\" height=\"25\" /> then\n</p><p>~bluesoul\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME\" title=\"1986 AIME\">1986 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1986 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1986\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1986 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"198